# currently-{{.Kind}}-{{.Name}}

A Currently {{.Kind}} plugin, created by `currently plugin new`.

```sh
go mod tidy
go build -o currently-{{.Kind}}-{{.Name}}{{.Exe}}
```

Copy the executable to a plugin directory (`currently plugin list` shows them),
then check it with `currently plugin info {{.Name}}`.
{{if not .SDKPath}}
Currently is not published as a Go module yet. Until it is, add a replace
line to go.mod that points at a Currently checkout, or create the plugin with
`currently plugin new --sdk /path/to/currently`.
{{end}}
